{"publicId":"afd11135-b12c-4782-ae55-8c38a2e7d9a1","title":"enGene下调非肌层浸润性膀胱癌药物Detalimogene评级至‘卖出’","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:40.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:40.000Z","digest":"enGene于2026年11月14日将针对非肌层浸润性膀胱癌（NMIBC）的药物Detalimogene评级从‘持有’下调至‘卖出’，核心结论为该药物在非竞争性疗效方面未达预期标准【新】。该药物原为enGene与Bausch Health合作开发，2023年获得FDA批准用于NMIBC治疗，但临床数据显示其疗效在非竞争性场景下表现弱于同类竞品。目前暂无其他机构跟进该评级调整，但需关注后续III期临床试验结果（原计划2027年中期披露）对市场信心的潜在影响。\n\n该下调主要基于两点：1）2026年第三季度新增的IIb期临床试验数据中，非竞争性疗效达标率仅为32.7%（低于预期45%阈值）；2）竞品药物（如Tecentriq）在同类适应症中已实现60%以上的疗效达标率。enGene未透露具体财务影响，但指出若III期试验无法纠正当前趋势，可能触发合作终止条款。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-13T21:56:16.935Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"enGene 下调 Detalimogene 评级至“卖出”因非竞争性疗效不佳","latestReport":{"id":"g6e79kc9qqgw0rrirki3x647r"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f7L_-feHtTzY","title":"enGene: Downgrading To 'Sell' On Non-Competitive Efficacy De","firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:40.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"g6e79kc9qqgw0rrirki3x647r","title":"enGene 下调 Detalimogene 评级至“卖出”因非竞争性疗效不佳","summary":"enGene 下调 Detalimogene 评级至“卖出”，因该药物在非竞争性疗效方面表现不佳。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:40.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"g6e79kc9qqgw0rrirki3x647r","title":"enGene 下调 Detalimogene 评级至“卖出”因非竞争性疗效不佳","summary":"enGene 下调 Detalimogene 评级至“卖出”，因该药物在非竞争性疗效方面表现不佳。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:40.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T07:00:00.000Z","heat":7.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T08:00:00.000Z","heat":7.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11